{"ok":true,"name":"Sonny Boys","desc":"Willi Clark (Harald Juhnke) and Al Lewis (Wolfgang Spier) were once one of the greatest comedian duos. They delighted audiences for over forty years, but one day the friends broke up over a small argument. When the television approaches them and asks them to perform one of their most famous laughing numbers again, the two are immediately enthusiastic. In the face of the fact that they are finally back in the limelight, they forget their old quarrel. However, the peace does not last long, because already during the rehearsals there are new turbulent arguments between the two bartenders .","year":1995,"rating":null,"ratingCount":null,"thumb":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/24HgDiETccZFwnORhcfHVaRupEp.jpg","servers":[{"name":"Server 1","src":"https://videm.xyz/embed/movie/tt0458954&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 2","src":"https://vidapi.xyz/embed/movie/680253"},{"name":"Server 3","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vnest?tmdb=680253&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 4","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vcr?tmdb=680253&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 5","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vpls?tmdb=680253&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 6","src":"https://embedmaster.link/movie/tt0458954"},{"name":"Server 7","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vesy?tmdb=680253&autostart=true"},{"name":"Server 8","src":"https://stream.vidapi.xyz/vsrc?imdb=tt0458954"}],"genres":[],"seasons":null,"duration":null,"imdb":"tt0458954","related":[{"id":16290,"slug":"jackass-3d","title":"Jackass 3D","type":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPirN07su7LFixyZyLrNMMQ9u1E.jpg"},{"id":1548113,"slug":"the-muppet-show","title":"The Muppet Show","type":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcwar1rL0neoLvnklL7DzYw7sN8.jpg"},{"id":1022690,"slug":"ricky-stanicky","title":"Ricky Stanicky","type":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJQdLfrpl4CQsHAKIxd3DJqYTVq.jpg"},{"id":16561,"slug":"the-sunshine-boys","title":"The Sunshine Boys","typ